  "prefLabel": "Plc 313.38 Substantially Similar Requirements for the Profession Regulated by the Midwifery Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 313.38 Substantially Similar Requirements for the Profession Regulated by the Midwifery Council. For purposes of obtaining a midwife license by endorsement, as regulated by the midwifery council, the current requirements of the licensing jurisdiction shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Certification as a Certified Professional Midwife by a nationally-recognized certifying body.\n\nSource. #13954, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #1 at part heading for Plc 313)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc300.html"
